# Tender section draft (deliverables, hours, timelines). An unreviewed draft, and this
# repository is public, so it is held out rather than published. It stays present in the
# working tree: scripts/diagram_architecture.py reads it to cross-check its module count,
# and skips that one check - saying so - when it is absent, so a clean clone still works.
# Nothing is deleted by this; remove the line to track the file again.
docs/tender-deliverables-hours-timeline.md
